{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37815","headline":"乖慵 · 郑谷","name":"乖慵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乖慵居竹里，凉冷卧池东。\n一霎芰荷雨，几回帘幕风。\n远僧来扣寂，小吏笑书空。\n衰鬓霜供白，愁颜酒借红。\n扇轻摇鹭羽，屏古画渔翁。\n自得无端趣，琴棊舫子中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37815.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37815","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}